* KDSA ECDSA and PCC scalar multiply on P-256, P-384 and P-521
* (Message-Security-Assist Extension 9, stage 1). Expected values from
* an independent reference model validated against the 'cryptography'
* package; the P-256 deterministic signature is the RFC 6979 A.2.5
* test vector (SHA-256, message "sample").

